        # Twice the black area in [0, x] x [0, y] for integers x, y,
        # computed by summing over unit cells in closed form per column.
        # Each 2x2 block is a fixed pattern with exactly 2 black unit cells,
        # so we use periodicity with period 2 in both directions.
